### Audio Transcription - Default Model (whisper-1 = base)
# Expected Response: Segments with start/end times in milliseconds
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< path/to/your/audio.mp3
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

whisper-1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="response_format"

json
--boundary--

### Audio Transcription - Tiny Model (Fastest, Lowest Accuracy)
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< path/to/your/audio.wav
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

tiny
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="response_format"

json
--boundary--

