### Audio Transcription with Prompt - OGG Format
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.ogg"
Content-Type: audio/ogg

< path/to/your/audio.ogg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

whisper-1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="prompt"

This is a technical discussion about AI and machine learning.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
--boundary--